  "html": "<table>\n<tr>\n<td><div class=\"center\"><div class=\"thumb tnone\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:454px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Vexationstation.jpg\" title=\"Vexation Station\"><img alt=\"Vexation Station\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"445\" src=\"/images/Vexationstation.jpg\" width=\"452\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/Vexationstation.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Vexation Station</div></div></div></div>\n</td><td><b>Vexation Station is the second outpost, it is reachable by a portal at level 5 <a href=\"/wiki/Algor's_Terror_Dome\" title=\"Algor's Terror Dome\">Algor's Terror Dome</a> or through a One Way Portal at <a href=\"/wiki/Algor's_Terror-Dome\" title=\"Algor's Terror-Dome\">Lair of the Snow Chieftain</a>. There are 2 portals, one leading back to level 5 Algor's Terror-Dome and another one leading to <a href=\"/wiki/Vergrim's_Vexation\" title=\"Vergrim's Vexation\">Vergrim's Vexation</a> level 1, and an obelisk.</b>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<a name=\"NPC.27s\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\"> NPC's </span></h2>\n<ul><li> <a href=\"/wiki/Ghostly_Guard\" title=\"Ghostly Guard\">Ghostly Guard</a>, who has no function, really, he just stands there, innocently, and any other idea about him is veiled in ... well, in Seacressy (nudge, nudge, hint, hint).\n</li></ul>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
